281
00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.119
Tetapi tidakkah anda fikir ia benar-benar kelihatan seperti dia?

282
00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.450
Ya, rambut perang ini, dia.

283
00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:24.130
Yoon Jiamin.

284
00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.860
Awak jumpa Kim Sun-chul tahun 3 malam tadi, bukan?

285
00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.130
- Ya. - Apa?

286
00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.000
Jadi anda berkata,

287
00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:41.869
kamu bercakap tentang belajar,

288
