289
00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.200
dan keluar dari hospital bersama-sama.

290
00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:47.530
ya.

291
00:17:47.531 --> 00:17:50.190
Itu kira-kira jam 10:45 malam.

292
00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:51.680
Betul.

293
00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.310
Ada lagi ke?

294
