365
00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:45.890
Hmm...

366
00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.160
Tiada bukti.

367
00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.449
Tolong bantu saya.

368
00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:12.329
Oh, awak kawan Sun-chul bro.

369
00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:14.320
